{"ID":"20240506082107-wnjc9il","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082107-wnjc9il","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082107-wnjc9il\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082107-zi18c4y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082107-zi18c4y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082107-zi18c4y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"231猬皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240821150725"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240626183913-7rerfx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626183913-7rerfx7","updated":"20240626183913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"猬皮2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/猬皮2-20240626183913-ri51k0o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626184216-8sjlhjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626184216-8sjlhjd","updated":"20240821150441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 405px;","style":"width: 395px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬4-20240626184216-rn2jwgy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 395px;\" parent-style=\"width: 405px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 457px;","style":"width: 447px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬-20240821150431-bgok2g3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 447px;\" parent-style=\"width: 457px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626183945-ckx7dqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626183945-ckx7dqa","updated":"20240821150556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬2-20240626184049-odop8t5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬 2-20240821150556-4xm7x5m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821150644-strxaxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821150644-strxaxi","updated":"20240821150725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬 3-20240821150644-fgy5lga.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 838px;","style":"width: 828px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬 4-20240821150725-pbktuyh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 828px;\" parent-style=\"width: 838px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626184618-b61yu59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626184618-b61yu59","updated":"20240821150739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1162px;","style":"width: 1152px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"刺猬5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/刺猬5-20240626184618-vbkc0py.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1152px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1162px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612123710-5gabr9t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123710-5gabr9t"}},{"ID":"20240612123711-rc9y8k7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123711-rc9y8k7","updated":"20240612123716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123711-exsdypa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123711-exsdypa","updated":"20240612123711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123711-8rpmwvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123711-8rpmwvg","updated":"20240612123711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色，血汁不止，阴肿痛引要背，酒煮杀之。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123711-7eewlmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123711-7eewlmk","updated":"20240612123711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生楚山田野，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123711-lgfd77d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123711-lgfd77d","updated":"20240612123711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：似豪猪者，或作猬。《广雅》云：虎王，猬也。《尔雅》云：汇毛刺。郭璞云：今谓状似鼠。《淮南子》说山训云：鹊矢中猬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124446-y1tgweb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124446-y1tgweb"}},{"ID":"20240612124447-5o0fm8q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124447-5o0fm8q","updated":"20240612124455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124447-ylxarqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124447-ylxarqa","updated":"20240612124447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主五痔，阴蚀，下血赤白五色，血汁不止，阴肿，痛引腰背，酒煮杀之，又疗腹痛，疝积，亦烧为灰，酒服之。生楚山川谷田野。取无时，勿使中湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124447-163uv25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124447-163uv25","updated":"20240612124447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得酒良，畏桔梗、麦门冬。田野中时有此兽，人犯近，便藏头足，毛刺人，不可得捉，能跳入虎耳中。而见鹊便自仰腹受啄，物有相制，不可思议尔。其脂烊铁注中，内少水银，则柔如铅锡矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124447-6iz5txc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124447-6iz5txc","updated":"20240612124447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕猬极狞钝，大者如小豚，小者犹瓜大，或恶鹊声，故反腹令啄，欲掩取之，犹蚌鹬尔。虎耳不受鸡卵，且去地三尺，猬何能跳之而入？野俗鄙说，遂为雅记，深可怪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123825-ruulj3w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123825-ruulj3w"}},{"ID":"20240612123826-6zaw52s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123826-6zaw52s","updated":"20240612123835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺猬皮《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123826-z63t4k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123826-z63t4k7","updated":"20240612123826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平，开胃气治胃逆，凉血。肉甘平，理胃气治反胃。脂滴耳聋。胆点痘后风眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124938-jztgm2q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124938-jztgm2q"}},{"ID":"20240612124939-wj4zqgg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124939-wj4zqgg","updated":"20240612124946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124939-6c9041x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124939-6c9041x","updated":"20240612124939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"释名：毛刺。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124939-pb3xfva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124939-pb3xfva","updated":"20240612124939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味：皮：苦、平、无毒。肉：甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124939-gut1bwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124939-gut1bwb","updated":"20240612124939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：胆：点目，止泪；化水，涂痔疮。肉：炙食，肥下焦，理胃气，令人能食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124939-zz41gpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124939-zz41gpa","updated":"20240612124939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皮：⑴、痔疮下血。用猬皮、穿山甲等分，烧存性，加肉豆蔻一半，每服一钱，空心服，热米汤送下。 ⑵、肠风下血。用猬皮一块，锅内烤焦，去皮留刺，加木贼半两（炒黑），共研为末。每服二钱，热酒调下。 ⑶、五色痢疾。用猬皮烧灰，酒送服二钱。⑷、大肠脱肛。用猬皮一斤（烧过），磁石（煅）、桂心各五钱，共研为末。每服二钱，米汤送下。⑸、鼻血不止。用猬皮一块，烧为末。取半钱，棉裹塞鼻中。⑹、睫毛倒刺。用猬刺、枣针、白芷表黛，等分为末，吸入与病眼同侧的鼻孔中，同时，口含冷水。⑺、反胃吐食。用猬皮烧灰，酒送服；或煮汁2服；或以五味淹猬皮。炙服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124042-75kq6bn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124042-75kq6bn"}},{"ID":"20240612124043-funld42","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-funld42","updated":"20240612124047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺猬皮《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124043-4klq4c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-4klq4c6","updated":"20240612124043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为刺猬皮科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥外皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124043-klx939r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-klx939r","updated":"20240612124043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』湖北、江西、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124043-5zxmhlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-5zxmhlf","updated":"20240612124043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』将原药日晒夜露5天，去其腥味，然后将锅用武火烧热，随即取刺猬皮将刺面朝下，烫去刺尖又翻一面，去其油质，取出用50～60度热水洗去泥沙和油腻，再用清水洗净，捞起晒干，切去头足和无刺边皮，再切6分见方小块。将锅烧热，用砂与刺猬皮同炒，炒至枯黄，取出筛去砂，又投入锅内用醋淬（每斤药用醋3两）吸匀炒干即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124043-t5maq5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-t5maq5g","updated":"20240612124043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』3～9克。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124043-9te2n5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124043-9te2n5p","updated":"20240612124043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装铁箱内加盖，防虫、鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123812-4zxhg3a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123812-4zxhg3a"}},{"ID":"20240612123813-l7h9fpx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-l7h9fpx","updated":"20240612123818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺猬皮《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-mq6rmu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-mq6rmu2","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为脊椎动物刺猬的外皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-5jqlovu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-5jqlovu","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】苦，平。入胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-3cye9h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-3cye9h2","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】行气止痛，化痰止血，固精缩尿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-rmxm4z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-rmxm4z5","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于胃脘疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-mv4g83g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-mv4g83g","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有行气止痛的功效，故可用于肝胃不和所致的胃脘疼痛，可单用本品一味，焙干，研末，每次吞服一钱，每天二次至二次；也可配合白朮、白芍、香附、香椽皮等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-r7x31ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-r7x31ze","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于痔疮便血，脱肛等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-jmho8sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-jmho8sm","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刺猬皮能化瘀止血，治痔疾有专长，用治痔疮便血，常与槐花、地榆等同用；如用于脱肛，可与补气药黄耆等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-2dplc6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-2dplc6l","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.用于遗精、遗尿等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-18laz2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-18laz2x","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品又有固精缩尿的功效，用于遗精、遗尿，常与固肾涩精药如益智仁、牡蛎、芡实等品配伍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-0f3izpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-0f3izpa","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】刺猬皮、炙猬皮（炒至微焦用）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-l4fhuvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-l4fhuvx","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。或焙干研末，每次吞服一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-b73x1eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-b73x1eg","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】遗尿二方（遵义医学院附属医院方）：炙刺猬皮、益智仁。治遗尿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-8s99tsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-8s99tsg","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主五痔阴蚀，下血赤白，五色血汁不止，阴肿痛引腰背。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612123813-ms8tgv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123813-ms8tgv8","updated":"20240612123813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》：「疗腹病疝积。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612124757-rtqgl4g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124757-rtqgl4g"}},{"ID":"20240612124759-d89mxxe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-d89mxxe","updated":"20240612124810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-qjfi9bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-qjfi9bv","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（古作彚，俗名刺猬）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-kzp3lxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-kzp3lxr","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平治胃逆（宗奭曰：开胃气有功，其字从虫从胃，深有理焉），肠风泻血，五痔（烧末，油调敷，水服亦佳），阴肿。煅黑存性。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-dmqvcqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-dmqvcqo","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-9t85f1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-9t85f1w","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平，理胃气，治反胃，令人能食，煮汁饮又主瘘。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-eekhnmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-eekhnmz","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脂"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-cfc6phc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-cfc6phc","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滴耳中治聋。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-hnihltj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-hnihltj","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胆"}]},{"ID":"20240612124759-rdlre17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124759-rdlre17","updated":"20240612124759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"点痘后风眼。似鼠而圆大，褐色攒毛，外刺如栗房。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124707-h78guer","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124707-h78guer"}},{"ID":"20240612124708-bpgf01f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124708-bpgf01f","updated":"20240612124716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124708-3yvi92b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124708-3yvi92b","updated":"20240612124708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主治五痔，阴蚀，下血赤白五色，血汁不止，阴肿，痛引腰背，酒煮杀之。又治腹痛，疝积，亦烧为灰，酒服之。生楚山川谷田野。取无时，勿使中湿。（得酒良，畏桔梗、麦门冬。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124708-g1c7mma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124708-g1c7mma","updated":"20240612124708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田野中时有此兽，人犯近，便藏头足，毛刺人，不可得捉，能跳入虎耳中。而见鹊便自仰腹受啄，物有相制，不可思议尔。其脂烊铁注中，内少水银，则柔如铅锡矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124630-0mdpjum","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124630-0mdpjum"}},{"ID":"20240612124631-mb62xy3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124631-mb62xy3","updated":"20240612124638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮毛《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124631-fk5y5mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124631-fk5y5mo","updated":"20240612124631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（类鼠属水，皮毛戟刺如针，属金，故味苦平，平即兼辛，大肠属金，以类相从，故能治大肠湿热，血热为病，及五痔阴蚀，下血不止也。阴肿痛引腰背，腹痛疝积，皆下焦湿热，邪气留结所致，辛以散之，苦以泄之，故主之也。肉味甘平，能开胃气，故止反胃，亦主痔瘘肠风者，皆去湿和胃之功也。凡食其肉，当捡去骨。若误食，令人瘦劣，诸节渐小也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124631-gcy51be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124631-gcy51be","updated":"20240612124631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮毛，烧灰热酒调服，主五痔，血流大肠，理诸疝痛引小腹，治胃逆而开胃气，塞鼻衄而消鼻痔，止腹胀痛，除阴肿痛。肉啖之易肥，仍理中，令人能食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124532-e7qs4cn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124532-e7qs4cn"}},{"ID":"20240612124533-vx1on20","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-vx1on20","updated":"20240612124542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-ss9clyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-ss9clyi","updated":"20240612124533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬鼠类，属水。其皮毛戟刺如针，属金。见鹊则仰腹受喙，火炼金。其气相制也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-p7c6lbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-p7c6lbj","updated":"20240612124533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"●皮"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-r7lgexg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-r7lgexg","updated":"20240612124544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦平，有小毒。主治五痔阴蚀，下血不止，痔痛有头，多年不瘥。止肠毒下血，疗腹痛疝积。（并烧灰，酒服之。）止衄，（烧灰，绵裹塞鼻。）疗反胃，（烧灰酒服，或煮汁，或五味淹炙。食此物，开胃气有功。其字从胃，深有理。）治胃逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-k2zaj1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-k2zaj1s","updated":"20240617115437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕猬皮之用，专于大肠，故疗痔病为多。夫痔所受病者燥气，为病者湿气也。或又曰：胃热也。何以明之？盖阳明燥金，以其阳盛趋阴，而阴气不能与之合，故为燥。人身身半以下属地，阴气主之。或因房劳劳力，虚其肾阴，则燥者益燥。更由胃中酒食积毒，归于大肠，以乘其阴虚之燥，则燥随化火以伤血。是谓收气不得职，致经脉横解，浊气污血，流注肛门。其始本燥与热合也，而热因与湿合。所谓湿气者，由阳不得真阴以收，既淫而为热。即阴不得真阳以化，更淫而为湿。以故痔初起显燥证，有便涩作痛之情，渐显湿证，有肿痛坚块之患。然则燥者病之本，湿者病之标，而热则病于标本之中也。夫热之合于燥也，为气伤。其合于湿也，为血伤。如肠中只有湿热，只病于下血而已。惟湿热本于燥，肠头斯有坚块，至于作痛者。热因燥乘，风因热化，而更蓄于湿以不得达，故大痛也。久之破而为漏，亦此之由耳。（湿圉其燥热风之气，则溃肠以出。治之宜兼破气药，又忌过用苦寒。盖用寒过剂，则真阳益病，而湿愈不行。）方书云：痔初成渐大，便涩作痛者，宜润燥及滋阴。嗣如肛门下坠，便血而疼痛坚硬者，宜清火渗湿。或紫色疼痛，大便虚闭作痒，宜凉血祛风，疏利湿热。又或肿痛坚硬，后重坠刺，便难者，外宜熏洗，内宜宣利。合而参之，初起之治，缓而先本。后此三证，热胜则肿痛，湿胜则坚硬下坠，皆当急而救标。本标之治，节次不爽，乃免穿肠溃决之患矣。猬皮于诸痔无不逐群剂以奏功。缪氏谓：猬属水，其皮得坚金之气，而和血于大肠，故治五痔阴蚀有专功。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-iokxpz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-iokxpz7","updated":"20240612124533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡食其肉，当去骨。误食令人瘦劣，诸节渐小。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124533-gbn8c7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124533-gbn8c7g","updated":"20240612124549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔辨治〕猪蹄者良，鼠脚者次。取皮入药，烧灰，或炙黄，或炒黑，或水煮，任入汤丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123735-128y9fl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123735-128y9fl"}},{"ID":"20240612123736-p548xmf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-p548xmf","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：刺猬皮"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-08mntij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-08mntij","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-236r1ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-236r1ch","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cì Wei Pí"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ktr943e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ktr943e","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ejxskf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ejxskf1","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 猬皮、刺鼠皮、刺球子皮"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-lishvih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-lishvih","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-y5392d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-y5392d7","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 刺猬科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Erinaceus europaeus L.或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"短刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hemichianus dauricus Sundevall的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"外皮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。将皮剥下，撒上一层石灰，置于通风处阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-q45i1e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-q45i1e9","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-duwetiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-duwetiv","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 将刺猬皮剪去毛，剁成小块，洗净，晒干，另取滑石粉置锅内炒热，加入刺猬皮，炒烫至呈焦黄色时，取出，筛去滑石粉即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-b0y4wur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-b0y4wur","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-3op1g3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-3op1g3n","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-tyffu8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-tyffu8z","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ha2wne9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ha2wne9","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-f71rcsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-f71rcsw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-n2puchv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-n2puchv","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 行瘀止痛，止血，固精。用于胃脘疼痛，子宫出血，便血，痔疮，遗精，遗尿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-87qbjtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-87qbjtg","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-c6sxn1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-c6sxn1j","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2～3钱，水煎服或焙黄研末服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1oelf7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1oelf7h","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-02xaugz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-02xaugz","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-pkjqwuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-pkjqwuf","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：刺猬皮"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-kk535jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-kk535jz","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-c4hiolp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-c4hiolp","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cì Wei Pí"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-2hmfgjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-2hmfgjp","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-f7vn9m3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-f7vn9m3","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 猬皮（《本经》），仙人衣（《山东中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-jgte8z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-jgte8z6","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-zi2m4zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-zi2m4zl","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草原始》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ksorvot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ksorvot","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-6ke4afz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-6ke4afz","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为刺猬科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"短刺猬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"皮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可捕捉，于冬眠时捕获更易。捕得后，用刀纵剖腹部，将皮剥下，翻开，撒上一层石灰，于通风处阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-8okvh99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-8okvh99","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-578dcpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-578dcpb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产河北、江苏、山东、河南、陕西、甘肃、内蒙古、浙江、安徽、吉林、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-gaxg5dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-gaxg5dl","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-3orvt0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-3orvt0w","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①刺猬（《本草原始》），又名：猬、毛刺（《尔雅》），白刺猬（《杨氏家藏方》），猬鼠（《纲目》），偷瓜蜮（姚可成《食物本草》），刺鼠（《随息居饮食谱》），偷瓜獾、刺血儿、刺球子、刺鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-p49z8n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-p49z8n3","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体形较大，体长约22厘米，尾长约2厘米。头宽，吻尖。耳短，不超过其周围之棘长。足及爪较长。身体背面被粗而硬的棘刺，头顶部之棘略向两侧分列。棘之颜色可分二类：一类纯白色，或尖端略染棕色；另一类棘之基部白色或土黄色，其上为棕色，再上段复为白色，尖梢呈棕色。整个体背呈土棕色。脸部、体侧和腹面以及四肢的毛为灰白或浅灰黄色。四足浅棕色。头骨之颔关节窝后突甚小，显然低于颞乳突之高。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-k0rrcmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-k0rrcmg","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖息于平原、丘陵或山地的灌木丛中，亦见于市郊、村落附近。昼伏夜出，冬眠期长达半年。遇敌则卷缩成一刺球。食物以昆虫及其幼虫为主，亦食幼鸟、鸟卵、蛙、蜥蜴，以及瓜果、蔬菜等。分布东北、华北、华东、华中，以至四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-vxbao2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-vxbao2j","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②短刺猬，又名：达呼尔刺猬、大耳猬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-9fjb35b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-9fjb35b","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外形同刺猬而略小。耳甚大，长于周围棘刺。棘由耳基前端稍后方起始，向后经背至尾部以上。头顶部棘不向两侧分列。棘较细而短，有棕褐色与白色相间，整个背部呈浅褐色。全身无白色之棘。腹毛土黄色。颔关节窝后突与顾乳突等高，二者连成半圆形的管状。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-u40z44b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-u40z44b","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖息于北方草原地带，低洼地方较多。亦有冬眠习惯。食昆虫、小鼠或蛙等小动物。分布吉林省西部、内蒙古东部，南至河北省北部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-3amtgmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-3amtgmm","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-uthyl22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-uthyl22","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的皮呈多角形板刷状或直条状，有的边缘卷曲成简状或盘状，长约3～4厘米。外表面密生错综交插的棘刺，刺长1.5～2厘米，坚硬如针，灰白色、黄色或灰褐色不一。在腹部的皮上多有灰褐色软毛。皮内面灰白色或棕褐色，留有筋肉残痕。具特殊腥臭气。以张大、肉脂刮净、刺毛整洁为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-mzmvzis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-mzmvzis","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1y7wdnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1y7wdnh","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上层的刺，是由角蛋白所成。此是主要成分。下层的真皮层，主要为胶原与其它蛋白质如弹性硬蛋白之类和脂肪等所成。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1eq04wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1eq04wj","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1xt3a6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1xt3a6k","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒刺猬皮：取拣净的刺猬皮，剁成小块，洗净，晒干，另取滑石粉置锅内炒热，加入刺猬皮，炒烫至黄色，取出，筛、刷去滑石粉，剪去毛，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-bdfh05d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-bdfh05d","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ypxuewu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ypxuewu","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草求真》：\"入肠、胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-izq6krh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-izq6krh","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草撮要》：\"入手足太阴、阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-kx0xjfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-kx0xjfj","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-wtvaivb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-wtvaivb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-hzbjzj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-hzbjzj4","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-7dna61l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-7dna61l","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-30i4i1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-30i4i1p","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"味甘，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-pfl3vhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-pfl3vhw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-up6strb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-up6strb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"得酒良。畏桔梗、麦门冬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-agnu6eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-agnu6eb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-nvnezhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-nvnezhb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 降气定痛，凉血止血。治反胃吐食，腹痛疝气，肠风痔漏，遗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-mwizgzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-mwizgzy","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止，阴肿痛引腰背，酒煮杀之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-dps0pi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-dps0pi1","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗腹痛疝积，烧为灰，酒服之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-3shtaes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-3shtaes","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"主肠风泻血，痔病有头，多年不瘥者，炙末白饮下方寸匕；烧末吹主鼻衄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-mzpdy07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-mzpdy07","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④孟诜：\"烧灰酒服治胃逆，又煮汁服止反胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-jl2bhs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-jl2bhs9","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草备要》：\"泻，凉血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-qaho6uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-qaho6uj","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本经逢原》：\"除目中翳障。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-t6qat9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-t6qat9i","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《随息居饮食谱》：\"煅研服，治遗精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-voe3yvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-voe3yvs","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-qmeytfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-qmeytfg","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～3钱；或入散剂。外用：研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-rou0ms6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-rou0ms6","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-13crjfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-13crjfl","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治反胃吐食：猬皮烧灰，酒服或煮汁，或五味淹炙食。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-oblurdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-oblurdz","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治肠风下血：白刺猬皮一枚（于铫子内煿针焦，去皮，只用针），木贼半两（炒黄）。上为细末。每服二钱，热酒调下，空心食前。（《杨氏家藏方》猬皮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-yctbs1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-yctbs1b","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治痔：猬皮、穿山甲等分，烧存性，入肉豆蔻-半，末之，空肚热米饮调二钱服。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-i4uzzs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-i4uzzs5","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肠痔下部如虫啮：猬皮烧末，生油和敷之。（《简要济众方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-c8o6q74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-c8o6q74","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治肛出：猬皮一枚，磁石四两，桂心一尺。上三味，治下筛。饮服方寸匕，日一服。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-gwmlb9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-gwmlb9j","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治五色痢疾：猬皮烧灰，酒服二钱。（《寿域神方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-25dmpmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-25dmpmw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治遗精：炒刺猬皮研末。每次二钱，日服二次。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-6lfcd1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-6lfcd1r","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治前列腺炎、肾结石：猬皮2个，焙干研末。分40包，早晚用米汤各送服1包。服药过程中可有尿道灼痛感，勿顾虑。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-70imixa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-70imixa","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治鼻衄：猬皮一枚，烧为灰，细研，每用半钱，绵裹纳鼻中，数易之。（《圣惠方》塞鼻散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-2hox40f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-2hox40f","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治鼻中息肉：猬皮炙末，绵裹塞之三日。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-n0wttmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-n0wttmg","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治猘犬咬人：猬皮、头发等分。烧末，水和饮一杯。若或已目赤口噤者，折齿下之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-r95xcg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-r95xcg0","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-9mvut56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-9mvut56","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"猬皮治大肠湿热血热为病，及五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止也。阴肿痛引腰背，腹痛疝积，皆下焦湿热邪气留结所致，辛以散之，苦以泄之，故主之也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-u63nluy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-u63nluy","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"猬皮，《本经》主五痔阴蚀，取其锐利破血也，酒煮治阴肿痛引腰背，取其筋脉能收纵也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-qh765nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-qh765nn","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-e9zk0rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-e9zk0rs","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-core1g3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-core1g3","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：刺猬皮"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-4xj3jnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-4xj3jnk","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-awwf72c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-awwf72c","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cì Wei Pí"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-bu2q4rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-bu2q4rd","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-v06mvpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-v06mvpw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 猬皮、仙人衣"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-kfk9nb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-kfk9nb7","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-byewlaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-byewlaj","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hedgehog Hide, Hedgehog Skin"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-066igue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-066igue","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-0xqnpro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-0xqnpro","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-6vwxglm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-6vwxglm","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：猬皮，生楚山川谷田野，取无时，勿使中湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-iohd1jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-iohd1jz","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：猬皮，勿用山枳鼠皮，正相似，但山枳毛端有两歧为别。又有虎鼠皮亦相类，但以味酸为别。又有山(犭追)皮，类兔皮，颇相似，其色褐，其味甚苦，亦不堪用。《图经》云，状如猯，豚脚、短刺，尾长寸余，苍白色，取去肉，火干良也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-9o83ej7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-9o83ej7","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-wafxwxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-wafxwxm","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为刺猬科动物刺猬、达乌尔猬、大耳猬的皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-i5p3vjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-i5p3vjj","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Erinaceus europaeus Linnaeus2.Hemiechinus dauricus Sundevall3.Hemiechinus auritus Gmelin"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-z9c9b07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-z9c9b07","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：多在春、秋季捕捉，捕后杀死、剥皮，刺毛向内，除去油脂、残肉等，用竹片将皮撑开悬放在通风处，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-82jdro6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-82jdro6","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-irbmsjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-irbmsjw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.栖息于山地森林、平地草原、开垦地及荒地、灌木或草丛等各种类型的环境中但以平原丘陵、灌木丛中为多。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-462amf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-462amf9","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栖息于干旱地区草原地带的低洼地及半荒漠地区的灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-yxb9lzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-yxb9lzw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.栖息于农田、庄园，砾石荒漠也能见到。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ln99gmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ln99gmr","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.广泛分布于东北及河北、山西、陕西、山东、江苏、安徽、浙江、河南、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-r9gak9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-r9gak9q","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于东北及山西、陕西、宁夏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-644x0yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-644x0yd","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于内蒙古、陕西、宁夏、甘肃、新疆等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-prnrb01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-prnrb01","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-5vh56me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-5vh56me","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.刺猬，体形肥短，体长16-27cm，体重400-900g。头守而吻尖、眼小，耳短，其长度不超过周围的刺长。体背面及两侧密生尖刺，刺粗而硬，四肢短小，爪较发达，尾短。刺猬脸部色较深为褐色。全身的尖刺颜色变异较大，大致可分为：一为纯白色，为数较少。一为基部白色或土黄色，中间棕色或黑褐色，尖端又为白色，因而整个体背呈土棕色。腹面及四肢有细而硬的白毛。四足浅褐色，尾上也覆有白毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-bcm0xtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-bcm0xtq","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.达乌尔刺猬体形较刺猬小，体长17.5-25cm。耳较长，超过其周围尖刺之长。刺短而细，棕褐色与白色相间，无纯白色尖刺。体背为浅棕褐色，体侧及腹面长有粗硬的污白色毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-89vweb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-89vweb2","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.大耳猬，体形较小，体长17-23cm。吻部甚尖，耳大，耳长为37-50mm，耳尖钝圆，显然超过其周围的尖刺。躯体背面覆有硬刺构成的甲胄，由头部耳后方开始，往后一直伸展到尾基部之前。体背部的尖刺为暗褐色与白色相间，也有少数全白色的刺。尾极短为棕褐色。为荒漠、半荒漠地带典型的种类。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-eyq85af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-eyq85af","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-kw3ymfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-kw3ymfb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品野生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-828bqvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-828bqvh","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-ozdyzci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-ozdyzci","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，干燥的皮呈多角形板刷状或直条状，有的边缘卷曲呈筒状或盘状，长3-4cm。外表面密生错综交插的棘刺，棘长1.5-2cm，坚硬如针，灰白色、黄色、灰褐色不一。腹部的皮上有灰褐色软毛。皮内面灰白色或棕褐色。具特殊腥臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-66thq7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-66thq7g","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-0scst7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-0scst7s","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 刺猬皮上层刺主要含角蛋白（keratin）；下层真皮层主要含胶原（collagen），弹性硬蛋白（elastin），脂肪等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-hy9c3d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-hy9c3d5","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-8vcfzku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-8vcfzku","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有止血作用和促进平滑肌蠕动作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-iudxbbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-iudxbbe","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-o6y9vsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-o6y9vsm","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒刺猬皮：取拣净的刺猬皮，剁成小块，洗净，晒干，另取滑石粉置锅内炒热，加入刺猬皮，炒烫至黄色，取出，筛、刷去滑石粉，剪去毛，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-xdf6coc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-xdf6coc","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-oj6d7ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-oj6d7ii","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃；大肠；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-efyeu1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-efyeu1z","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-am9q72q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-am9q72q","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；涩；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-mdxb9m6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-mdxb9m6","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-kxqqpn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-kxqqpn7","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1kxk6lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1kxk6lt","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-8zceopw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-8zceopw","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 化瘀止痛；收敛止血；涩精缩尿。主胃脘疼痛；反胃吐食；便血；肠风下血；痔漏；脱肛；遗精；遗尿"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-7kb1g3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-7kb1g3w","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-nk444h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-nk444h7","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-10g；研末，1.5-3g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-dtpw31j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-dtpw31j","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-gok9ezb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-gok9ezb","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：猬皮治大肠湿热血热为病，及五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止也。阴肿痛引腰背，腹痛疝积，皆下焦湿热邪气留结所致，辛以散之，苦以泻之，故主之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-pow97n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-pow97n5","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：猬皮，《本经》主五痔阴蚀，取其锐利破血也，酒煮治阴肿痛引腰背，取其筋脉能收纵也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-3vop47v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-3vop47v","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《神农本草经》：主五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止，阴肿痛引腰背，酒煮杀之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-x9t5f7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-x9t5f7x","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《名医别录》：疗腹痛疝积，烧为灰，酒服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-t7qfjn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-t7qfjn9","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：主肠风泻血，痔病有头，多年不瘥者，炙末白饮下方寸匕；烧末吹主鼻衄。6.孟诜：烧灰酒服治胃逆，又煮汁服止反胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-o9zo5l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-o9zo5l3","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草备要》：泻，凉血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-1a0ac7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-1a0ac7x","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经逢原》：除目中翳障。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-pcpm22p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-pcpm22p","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《随息居饮食谱》：煅研服，治遗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-b7oe3c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-b7oe3c2","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123736-d0qh2uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123736-d0qh2uv","updated":"20240612123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123739-z2blkqq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123739-z2blkqq"}},{"ID":"20240612123740-sm6u0g4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123740-sm6u0g4","updated":"20240612124227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微信文章"}]},{"ID":"20240612124229-q5xa19t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124229-q5xa19t"}},{"ID":"20240612124230-ort3g03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124230-ort3g03","updated":"20240612124230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猬皮、刺鼠皮、刺球子皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124230-97i2ac3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124230-97i2ac3","updated":"20240612124230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124230-ryqwygu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124230-ryqwygu","updated":"20240612124230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：猬皮，生楚山川谷田野，取无时，勿使中湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124230-lkvyget","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124230-lkvyget","updated":"20240612124230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：猬皮，勿用山枳鼠皮，正相似，但山枳毛端有两歧为别。又有虎鼠皮亦相类，但以味酸为别。又有山(犭追)皮，类兔皮，颇相似，其色褐，其味甚苦，亦不堪用。《图经》云，状如猯，豚脚、短刺，尾长寸余，苍白色，取去肉，火干良也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124230-b0tn17i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124230-b0tn17i","updated":"20240612124230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药材基源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：为刺猬科动物刺猬或短刺猬的皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124241-5duockv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124241-5duockv","updated":"20240612124243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.刺猬（《本草原始》），又名：猬、毛刺（《尔雅》），白刺猬（《杨氏家藏方》），猬鼠（《纲目》），偷瓜蜮（姚可成《食物本草》），刺鼠（《随息居饮食谱》），偷瓜獾、刺血儿、刺球子、刺鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124241-itah5ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124241-itah5ss","updated":"20240612124241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体形较大，体长约22厘米，尾长约2厘米。头宽，吻尖。耳短，不超过其周围之棘长。足及爪较长。身体背面被粗而硬的棘刺，头顶部之棘略向两侧分列。棘之颜色可分二类：一类纯白色，或尖端略染棕色；另一类棘之基部白色或土黄色，其上为棕色，再上段复为白色，尖梢呈棕色。整个体背呈土棕色。脸部、体侧和腹面以及四肢的毛为灰白或浅灰黄色。四足浅棕色。头骨之颔关节窝后突甚小，显然低于颞乳突之高。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124241-z2c8drj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124241-z2c8drj","updated":"20240612124241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昼伏夜出，冬眠期长达半年。遇敌则卷缩成一刺球。食物以昆虫及其幼虫为主，亦食幼鸟、鸟卵、蛙、蜥蜴，以及瓜果、蔬菜等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-5xiv2p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-5xiv2p7","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.短刺猬，又名：达呼尔刺猬、大耳猬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-pc6xbrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-pc6xbrj","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外形同刺猬而略小。耳甚大，长于周围棘刺。棘由耳基前端稍后方起始，向后经背至尾部以上。头顶部棘不向两侧分列。棘较细而短，有棕褐色与白色相间，整个背部呈浅褐色。全身无白色之棘。腹毛土黄色。颔关节窝后突与顾乳突等高，二者连成半圆形的管状。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-878lfwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-878lfwy","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦有冬眠习惯。食昆虫、小鼠或蛙等小动物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-kjyckmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-kjyckmm","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部：1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖息于平原、丘陵或山地的灌木丛中，亦见于市郊、村落附近"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-sft8moe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-sft8moe","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栖息于北方草原地带，低洼地方较多。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-eawng26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-eawng26","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"资源分布："}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-154733x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-154733x","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.分布东北、华北、华东、华中，以至四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-s1dcjyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-s1dcjyi","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布吉林省西部、内蒙古东部，南至河北省北部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-391bdn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-391bdn8","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"采制："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将皮剥下，撒上一层石灰，置于通风处阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124255-hakhbpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124255-hakhbpl","updated":"20240612124255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栽培："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品野生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-nfquk9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-nfquk9p","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状鉴别："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥的皮呈多角形板刷状或直条状，有的边缘卷曲呈筒状或盘状，长3-4cm。外表面密生错综交插的棘刺，棘长1.5-2cm，坚硬如针，灰白色、黄色、灰褐色不一。腹部的皮上有灰褐色软毛。皮内面灰白色或棕褐色。具特殊腥臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-u0afvvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-u0afvvy","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药理作用："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有止血作用和促进平滑肌蠕动作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-3be8xrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-3be8xrm","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒刺猬皮：取拣净的刺猬皮，剁成小块，洗净，晒干，另取滑石粉置锅内炒热，加入刺猬皮，炒烫至黄色，取出，筛、刷去滑石粉，剪去毛，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-sf58qv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-sf58qv2","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，涩，性平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-vot6zvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-vot6zvb","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本经》：\"味苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-k8c611o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-k8c611o","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612124323-7fb46oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124323-7fb46oi","updated":"20240612124326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：\"味甘，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-196d14y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-196d14y","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃，大肠，肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-fj7u71q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-fj7u71q","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化瘀止痛，收敛止血，涩精缩尿。主胃脘疼痛，反胃吐食，便血，肠风下血，痔漏，脱肛，遗精，遗尿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-01iknb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-01iknb3","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：煎汤，3-10g；研末，1.5-3g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-qixn2bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-qixn2bw","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-mxd4p43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-mxd4p43","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草经集注》：\"得酒良。畏桔梗、麦门冬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-jzqnkey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-jzqnkey","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述："}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-6c97xir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-6c97xir","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：猬皮治大肠湿热血热为病，及五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止也。阴肿痛引腰背，腹痛疝积，皆下焦湿热邪气留结所致，辛以散之，苦以泻之，故主之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-9yqagop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-9yqagop","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：猬皮，《本经》主五痔阴蚀，取其锐利破血也，酒煮治阴肿痛引腰背，取其筋脉能收纵也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-5seds47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-5seds47","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《神农本草经》：主五痔阴蚀下血，赤白五色血汁不止，阴肿痛引腰背，酒煮杀之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-fb9txth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-fb9txth","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《名医别录》：疗腹痛疝积，烧为灰，酒服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-rnk4879","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-rnk4879","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：主肠风泻血，痔病有头，多年不瘥者，炙末白饮下方寸匕；烧末吹主鼻衄。6.孟诜：烧灰酒服治胃逆，又煮汁服止反胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-d1m19qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-d1m19qi","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草备要》：泻，凉血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-ve90j2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-ve90j2d","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经逢原》：除目中翳障。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-u7esjx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-u7esjx2","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《随息居饮食谱》：煅研服，治遗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-c4gnhnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-c4gnhnb","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"配伍："}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-x8dxi23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-x8dxi23","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.配香附：香附行气解郁，以治气郁;刺猬皮活血祛瘀，以治血郁。二药相合，使气血流畅、脉行通利、郁滞得解，诸症悉除。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-kapm8yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-kapm8yd","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.配槐花：槐花专清大肠湿热，凉血止血，刺猬皮活血化瘀，宽肠下气，二药相合，清肠止血，疏风下气，风热湿毒一清，便血自止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-oc7qf60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-oc7qf60","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.配蝉蜕：蝉蜕清热明目退翳，刺猬皮除目中翳障，二药相伍，常用于风热壅盛、翳膜遮睛之证，对于外伤性角膜损害遗留的翳障，也可酌情选用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-clnoc2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-clnoc2o","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.配沙苑子：沙苑子补肾涩精，治腰痛泄精、虚损劳乏;刺猬皮亦补肾涩精，煅研服治遗精。二药相合，补肾治本，涩精治标，若刺猬皮煅研成粉，用沙苑子煎汤送服，其效如神。"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-s9nxlur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-s9nxlur","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"附方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-mf6sc04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-mf6sc04","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治反胃吐食：猬皮烧灰，酒服或煮汁，或五味淹炙食。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-gwsfbij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-gwsfbij","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治肠风下血：白刺猬皮一枚（于铫子内煿针焦，去皮，只用针），木贼半两（炒黄）。上为细末。每服二钱，热酒调下，空心食前。（《杨氏家藏方》猬皮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-szfe9vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-szfe9vi","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治痔：猬皮、穿山甲等分，烧存性，入肉豆蔻-半，末之，空肚热米饮调二钱服。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-czvp89b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-czvp89b","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肠痔下部如虫啮：猬皮烧末，生油和敷之。（《简要济众方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-seh76vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-seh76vj","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治肛出：猬皮一枚，磁石四两，桂心一尺。上三味，治下筛。饮服方寸匕，日一服。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-wg9ka4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-wg9ka4s","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治五色痢疾：猬皮烧灰，酒服二钱。（《寿域神方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-izarjfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-izarjfh","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治遗精：炒刺猬皮研末。每次二钱，日服二次。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-wtd0nxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-wtd0nxl","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治前列腺炎、肾结石：猬皮2个，焙干研末。分40包，早晚用米汤各送服1包。服药过程中可有尿道灼痛感，勿顾虑。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-qku4dqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-qku4dqp","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治鼻衄：猬皮一枚，烧为灰，细研，每用半钱，绵裹纳鼻中，数易之。（《圣惠方》塞鼻散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-v93j3r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-v93j3r0","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治鼻中息肉：猬皮炙末，绵裹塞之三日。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124307-v64jipa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124307-v64jipa","updated":"20240612124307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治猘犬咬人：猬皮、头发等分。烧末，水和饮一杯。若或已目赤口噤者，折齿下之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612124310-6xf3ypn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612124310-6xf3ypn"}},{"ID":"20240612124311-1xq39e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612124311-1xq39e6"}}]}